## Observer Pattern

### Konsep
Observer adalah behavioral design pattern di mana sebuah objek (Subject/Publisher) memaintain list dependents (Observers/Subscribers) dan memberitahu mereka secara otomatis saat state berubah.

**Use case nyata:** sistem notifikasi, event handling, reactive programming, pub-sub messaging.

### Implementasi Python

```python
from __future__ import annotations
from abc import ABC, abstractmethod
from typing import List


class Observer(ABC):
    @abstractmethod
    def update(self, event: str, data: dict) -> None:
        ...


class Subject:
    def __init__(self):
        self._observers: List[Observer] = []

    def subscribe(self, observer: Observer) -> None:
        if observer not in self._observers:
            self._observers.append(observer)

    def unsubscribe(self, observer: Observer) -> None:
        self._observers.remove(observer)

    def notify(self, event: str, data: dict) -> None:
        for observer in self._observers:
            observer.update(event, data)


# ---- Contoh: Sistem E-commerce ----

class OrderSystem(Subject):
    def place_order(self, order_id: str, product: str) -> None:
        print(f"[Order] Pesanan #{order_id} untuk '{product}' dibuat")
        self.notify("order_placed", {"order_id": order_id, "product": product})

    def ship_order(self, order_id: str) -> None:
        print(f"\n[Order] Pesanan #{order_id} dikirim")
        self.notify("order_shipped", {"order_id": order_id})


class EmailNotifier(Observer):
    def update(self, event: str, data: dict) -> None:
        if event == "order_placed":
            print(f"  📧 Email: 'Terima kasih! Pesanan {data['order_id']} diterima.'")
        elif event == "order_shipped":
            print(f"  📧 Email: 'Pesanan {data['order_id']} dalam perjalanan!'")


class SMSNotifier(Observer):
    def update(self, event: str, data: dict) -> None:
        print(f"  📱 SMS: Update pesanan {data.get('order_id')} — {event}")


class InventorySystem(Observer):
    def update(self, event: str, data: dict) -> None:
        if event == "order_placed":
            print(f"  📦 Inventory: Kurangi stok '{data['product']}'")


# Demo
order_system = OrderSystem()
order_system.subscribe(EmailNotifier())
order_system.subscribe(SMSNotifier())
order_system.subscribe(InventorySystem())

order_system.place_order("ORD-001", "Laptop")
order_system.ship_order("ORD-001")
```

**Output:**
```
[Order] Pesanan #ORD-001 untuk 'Laptop' dibuat
  📧 Email: 'Terima kasih! Pesanan ORD-001 diterima.'
  📱 SMS: Update pesanan ORD-001 — order_placed
  📦 Inventory: Kurangi stok 'Laptop'

[Order] Pesanan #ORD-001 dikirim
  📧 Email: 'Pesanan ORD-001 dalam perjalanan!'
  📱 SMS: Update pesanan ORD-001 — order_shipped
```

### Kapan Pakai Observer?
- Perubahan satu objek butuh update banyak objek lain
- Objek tidak tahu berapa banyak listener yang ada
- Ingin loosely coupled architecture — sender tidak perlu tahu siapa yang mendengarkan

Berikut landing page untuk **Senja Kopi** dalam satu file HTML. Simpan sebagai `index.html`, lalu buka langsung di browser tanpa perlu instalasi apa pun.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Senja Kopi — Kopi Lokal untuk Menutup Hari</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Senja Kopi menyajikan kopi dari biji pilihan petani lokal Indonesia. Lihat menu, jam buka, dan lokasi kami.">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #fbf7f2;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --text: #2b1d14;
      --muted: #6f5b4b;
      --brand: #b5532a;
      --brand-dark: #8a3c1b;
      --accent: #f2c48d;
      --line: rgba(43, 29, 20, 0.12);
      --radius: 16px;
      --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(43, 29, 20, 0.08);
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    svg { display: block; }
    .container { width: min(100% - 2rem, 1120px); margin-inline: auto; }
    :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: .85rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid transparent;
      font: inherit; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform .2s, background-color .2s;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--brand); color: #fff; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--brand-dark); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-ghost { border-color: currentColor; color: var(--text); }

    /* Header */
    .header {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
      background: rgba(251, 247, 242, .92); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .nav { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 68px; }
    .logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.3rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .logo span { color: var(--brand); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.75rem; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--brand); }
    .menu-toggle { display: none; background: none; border: 0; padding: .5rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text); }

    /* Hero */
    .hero { padding: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem) 0; }
    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block; background: #f6e3cf; color: var(--brand-dark);
      padding: .35rem .8rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600;
    }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.6rem); line-height: 1.1; margin: 1rem 0; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
    .hero p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 34rem; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    .hero-art {
      aspect-ratio: 1; display: grid; place-items: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #f7d9b5, #e9a874 60%, #b5532a);
      border-radius: 40% 60% 55% 45% / 50% 40% 60% 50%;
    }
    .hero-art svg { width: 62%; }

    /* Sections */
    section { padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem) 0; }
    .section-title { text-align: center; max-width: 40rem; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; }
    .section-title h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem); margin: 0 0 .5rem; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .section-title p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
    .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
    .card { background: var(--surface); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.75rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .card h3 { margin: 1rem 0 .4rem; }
    .card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .icon { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px; background: #f6e3cf; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 1.5rem; }

    /* Menu */
    .tabs { display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .tab {
      padding: .6rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--surface); color: var(--muted); font: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .tab[aria-selected="true"] { background: var(--text); border-color: var(--text); color: #fff; }
    .menu-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0 2.5rem; }
    .menu-item { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .75rem; padding: 1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line); }
    .menu-item h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .menu-item p { margin: .2rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; }
    .price { margin-left: auto; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand); white-space: nowrap; }
    .badge {
      margin-left: .4rem; padding: .1rem .5rem; border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: middle;
    }

    /* Visit */
    .visit { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; align-items: start; }
    .visit h2 { margin-top: 0; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem); }
    .hours { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1.25rem 0 0; }
    .hours li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: .6rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .status {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; padding: .4rem .9rem; border-radius: 999px;
      background: #fdecea; color: #a12b1f; font-weight: 700;
    }
    .status.open { background: #e7f6ec; color: #1d7a3e; }
    .status::before { content: ""; width: .6rem; height: .6rem; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; }
    .map {
      min-height: 280px; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 2rem; text-align: center;
      border-radius: var(--radius); color: var(--muted);
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #efe4d8 0 12px, #f6ede3 12px 24px);
    }
    .site-footer { padding: 2rem 0; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .hero-grid, .visit, .features, .menu-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-art { width: min(100%, 320px); margin-inline: auto; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .menu-toggle { display: block; }
      .nav-links {
        display: none; position: absolute; top: 68px; left: -1rem; right: -1rem;
        flex-direction: column; gap: 0; background: var(--bg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .nav-links.open { display: flex; }
      .nav-links a { display: block; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      * { transition: none !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="header">
    <nav class="container nav" aria-label="Navigasi utama">
      <a href="#" class="logo">Senja<span>Kopi</span></a>
      <button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-links" aria-label="Buka menu">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/></svg>
      </button>
      <ul class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#tentang">Tentang</a></li>
        <li><a href="#menu">Menu</a></li>
        <li><a href="#kunjungi">Kunjungi</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Kopi lokal · Diseduh setiap hari</span>
          <h1>Secangkir kopi untuk menutup harimu.</h1>
          <p>Biji kopi pilihan dari petani Gayo, Toraja, dan Flores, kami sangrai sendiri dalam jumlah kecil supaya setiap cangkir selalu segar.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#menu" class="btn btn-primary">Lihat Menu</a>
            <a href="#kunjungi" class="btn btn-ghost">Cara ke Sini</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none">
            <path d="M80 30c-8 12 8 18 0 30M100 24c-8 12 8 18 0 30M120 30c-8 12 8 18 0 30" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".8"/>
            <path d="M150 92h10a20 20 0 0 1 0 40h-14" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M40 80h110v40a55 55 0 0 1-110 0z" fill="#fff"/>
            <ellipse cx="95" cy="82" rx="52" ry="8" fill="#6b3a1e"/>
            <path d="M30 184h130" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="tentang">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Kenapa Senja Kopi?</h2>
          <p>Kami percaya kopi yang enak dimulai dari hubungan yang adil dengan petani.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="features">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🌱</div>
            <h3>Single origin</h3>
            <p>Setiap biji bisa ditelusuri sampai ke kebun asalnya. Rasanya jujur, khas daerahnya.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🔥</div>
            <h3>Sangrai sendiri</h3>
            <p>Kami sangrai seminggu sekali dalam batch kecil, jadi kopi yang kamu minum selalu segar.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">💻</div>
            <h3>Nyaman untuk kerja</h3>
            <p>Wi-Fi kencang, colokan di setiap meja, dan musik yang tidak terlalu keras.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="menu">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Menu Kami</h2>
          <p>Harga sudah termasuk pajak. Bisa pesan untuk dibawa pulang.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Kategori menu">
          <button class="tab" type="button" role="tab" id="tab-kopi" data-category="kopi" aria-controls="menu-panel">Kopi</button>
          <button class="tab" type="button" role="tab" id="tab-nonkopi" data-category="nonkopi" aria-controls="menu-panel">Non-kopi</button>
          <button class="tab" type="button" role="tab" id="tab-makanan" data-category="makanan" aria-controls="menu-panel">Makanan</button>
        </div>
        <div class="menu-grid" id="menu-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-kopi"></div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <section id="kunjungi">
      <div class="container visit">
        <div>
          <h2>Mampir, yuk!</h2>
          <p id="open-status" class="status" role="status">Memeriksa jam buka…</p>
          <p>Jl. Contoh Raya No. 12, Bandung<br>Parkir motor dan mobil tersedia.</p>
          <ul class="hours">
            <li><span>Senin – Jumat</span><span>07.00 – 22.00</span></li>
            <li><span>Sabtu – Minggu</span><span>08.00 – 23.00</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <!-- Ganti dengan <iframe> dari Google Maps: Bagikan → Sematkan peta. -->
        <div class="map">Tempat untuk peta lokasi</div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">© <span id="year"></span> Senja Kopi. Dibuat dengan cinta dan kafein.</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Navigasi mobile
    const toggle = document.querySelector('.menu-toggle');
    const navLinks = document.getElementById('nav-links');

    function setMenu(open) {
      navLinks.classList.toggle('open', open);
      toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
      toggle.setAttribute('aria-label', open ? 'Tutup menu' : 'Buka menu');
    }
    toggle.addEventListener('click', () => setMenu(!navLinks.classList.contains('open')));
    navLinks.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      if (e.target.closest('a')) setMenu(false);
    });

    // Data menu
    const MENU = {
      kopi: [
        { name: 'Kopi Susu Senja', desc: 'Espresso, susu segar, gula aren', price: 22000, badge: 'Favorit' },
        { name: 'Es Kopi Aren', desc: 'Double shot dengan sirup aren asli', price: 24000 },
        { name: 'Cappuccino', desc: 'Espresso dan busa susu lembut', price: 28000 },
        { name: 'V60 Gayo', desc: 'Seduh manual, rasa buah dan cokelat', price: 30000 },
        { name: 'Kopi Tubruk Toraja', desc: 'Pekat, tradisional, tanpa ampas berlebih', price: 20000 }
      ],
      nonkopi: [
        { name: 'Matcha Latte', desc: 'Matcha dan susu segar', price: 28000 },
        { name: 'Cokelat Panas', desc: 'Cokelat hitam 60%', price: 25000 },
        { name: 'Teh Tarik', desc: 'Teh hitam dan susu kental manis', price: 20000 }
      ],
      makanan: [
        { name: 'Croissant Mentega', desc: 'Dipanggang setiap pagi', price: 22000 },
        { name: 'Pisang Goreng Keju', desc: 'Pisang kepok, keju, susu', price: 20000, badge: 'Baru' },
        { name: 'Nasi Goreng Kampung', desc: 'Dengan telur ceplok dan kerupuk', price: 32000 }
      ]
    };

    const rupiah = new Intl.NumberFormat('id-ID', {
      style: 'currency', currency: 'IDR', minimumFractionDigits: 0, maximumFractionDigits: 0
    });
    const panel = document.getElementById('menu-panel');
    const tabs = [...document.querySelectorAll('[role="tab"]')];

    function renderMenu(category) {
      panel.replaceChildren(...MENU[category].map((item) => {
        const row = document.createElement('div');
        row.className = 'menu-item';
        const info = document.createElement('div');
        const title = document.createElement('h3');
        title.textContent = item.name;
        if (item.badge) {
          const badge = document.createElement('span');
          badge.className = 'badge';
          badge.textContent = item.badge;
          title.append(badge);
        }
        const desc = document.createElement('p');
        desc.textContent = item.desc;
        info.append(title, desc);
        const price = document.createElement('span');
        price.className = 'price';
        price.textContent = rupiah.format(item.price);
        row.append(info, price);
        return row;
      }));
    }

    function selectTab(tab) {
      tabs.forEach((t) => {
        const selected = t === tab;
        t.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(selected));
        t.tabIndex = selected ? 0 : -1;
      });
      panel.setAttribute('aria-labelledby', tab.id);
      renderMenu(tab.dataset.category);
    }

    tabs.forEach((tab, i) => {
      tab.addEventListener('click', () => selectTab(tab));
      tab.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
        if (e.key !== 'ArrowRight' && e.key !== 'ArrowLeft') return;
        const step = e.key === 'ArrowRight' ? 1 : tabs.length - 1;
        const next = tabs[(i + step) % tabs.length];
        next.focus();
        selectTab(next);
      });
    });
    selectTab(tabs[0]);

    // Status buka/tutup berdasarkan jam perangkat pengunjung (0 = Minggu)
    const HOURS = { 0: [8, 23], 1: [7, 22], 2: [7, 22], 3: [7, 22], 4: [7, 22], 5: [7, 22], 6: [8, 23] };
    const statusEl = document.getElementById('open-status');
    const pad = (h) => String(h).padStart(2, '0') + '.00';

    function updateStatus() {
      const now = new Date();
      const [open, close] = HOURS[now.getDay()];
      const hour = now.getHours() + now.getMinutes() / 60;
      const isOpen = hour >= open && hour < close;
      statusEl.classList.toggle('open', isOpen);
      if (isOpen) {
        statusEl.textContent = `Buka sekarang · tutup pukul ${pad(close)}`;
      } else {
        const opensToday = hour < open;
        const nextOpen = opensToday ? open : HOURS[(now.getDay() + 1) % 7][0];
        statusEl.textContent = `Sedang tutup · buka ${opensToday ? 'hari ini' : 'besok'} pukul ${pad(nextOpen)}`;
      }
    }
    updateStatus();
    setInterval(updateStatus, 60 * 1000);

    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
```

**Cek kebutuhan**
- **Landing page Senja Kopi** → hero, keunggulan, menu, serta info kunjungan, dengan navigasi ke setiap bagian.
- **Modern dan keren** → ilustrasi cangkir dari SVG inline, palet hangat lewat variabel CSS, kartu berbayangan lembut, dan judul besar yang responsif dengan `clamp()`.
- **Nyaman di HP** → layout satu kolom di layar kecil dan menu hamburger dengan `aria-expanded`.

**Nilai tambah**
- Menu bertab (Kopi, Non-kopi, Makanan) dirender dari objek `MENU`. Harga berformat Rupiah lewat `Intl.NumberFormat`, dan tab bisa dipindah dengan tombol panah.
- Status "Buka sekarang" atau "Sedang tutup" dihitung dari `HOURS` oleh `updateStatus()` dan diperbarui setiap menit.

**Cara menyesuaikan**
- Ubah menu di `MENU`, jam buka di `HOURS`, dan warna merek di `:root`.
- Ganti placeholder peta dengan `<iframe>` dari Google Maps (Bagikan → Sematkan peta).
- Halaman ini sengaja tidak memuat testimoni karangan. Jika ingin menambah bagian ulasan, pakai ulasan asli dari pelanggan.

Berikut website portfolio untuk Raka Pratama dalam satu file HTML, lengkap dengan dark mode, filter proyek, dan form kontak tervalidasi.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Raka Pratama — Web Developer</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Portfolio Raka Pratama, web developer yang membangun aplikasi web yang cepat dan mudah diakses.">
  <script>
    // Terapkan tema sebelum halaman dirender supaya tidak berkedip.
    (function () {
      let theme = null;
      try { theme = localStorage.getItem('theme'); } catch (e) { /* storage diblokir */ }
      if (theme !== 'light' && theme !== 'dark') {
        theme = matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light';
      }
      document.documentElement.dataset.theme = theme;
    })();
  </script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f8fafc; --surface: #ffffff; --text: #0f172a; --muted: #475569;
      --border: #e2e8f0; --brand: #4f46e5; --brand-soft: #eef2ff;
      --danger: #dc2626; --success: #15803d;
    }
    [data-theme="dark"] {
      --bg: #0b1120; --surface: #111a2e; --text: #e2e8f0; --muted: #94a3b8;
      --border: #1e293b; --brand: #818cf8; --brand-soft: #1e1b4b;
      --danger: #f87171; --success: #4ade80;
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6;
      transition: background-color .3s, color .3s;
    }
    a { color: var(--brand); }
    .container { width: min(100% - 2rem, 1040px); margin-inline: auto; }
    :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--brand); outline-offset: 2px; }

    header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; height: 64px; }
    .logo { font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); }
    .nav-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.25rem; }
